{"action":"issue","adjudicationId":"no-three-in-line/d77-two-removal-rigidity-of-embedded-g76-record","baseRevisionId":null,"evidence":[{"digest":null,"id":"dfc0cc40d41105292a119840dcdbe6f22860cf43","kind":"transaction","relation":"context"},{"digest":null,"id":"c5e8096d942d57228bb4fed00f7617fb6b43af9f","kind":"transaction","relation":"supports"},{"digest":"sha256:71fbde8d269728a92be52f6401e857230043ee6938c45f810c32308d88fb9927","id":"sha256:71fbde8d269728a92be52f6401e857230043ee6938c45f810c32308d88fb9927","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"}],"issuedAtLedgerHead":"32422f71f16742f4b5b21b2b0d3e521ea80fd1f6","nodeId":"no-three-in-line/d77-two-removal-rigidity-of-embedded-g76-record","nodeType":"claim","parentId":"root","reportRef":{"artifact":"report.md","digest":"sha256:e31f2ee45062e97daaee63a38716f5d2ea4c6d50f02e9f3f5714c515e8b37ce6","section":"## Node: no-three-in-line/d77-two-removal-rigidity-of-embedded-g76-record"},"revisionId":"sha256:008360e597690ed395d0931f7c87f8f7324c8b4815dea535d656570b73aed92b","revisionNumber":1,"status":"active","subjects":[{"id":"c5e8096d942d57228bb4fed00f7617fb6b43af9f","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":2}],"summary":"For each specified embedding, removing two embedded points frees at most one originally outside cell. Exactly 16 removal pairs free a cell, distributed over four cells with four pairs per cell, and every freeing uses the reported two-lines-of-two mechanism. Removal depth three or greater is not addressed.","title":"Two-removal rigidity of the specified embedded G_76 configurations"}
{"action":"issue","adjudicationId":"no-three-in-line/d77-distance-from-embedded-g76-152-record","baseRevisionId":null,"evidence":[{"digest":null,"id":"dfc0cc40d41105292a119840dcdbe6f22860cf43","kind":"transaction","relation":"context"},{"digest":null,"id":"c5e8096d942d57228bb4fed00f7617fb6b43af9f","kind":"transaction","relation":"supports"},{"digest":"sha256:71fbde8d269728a92be52f6401e857230043ee6938c45f810c32308d88fb9927","id":"sha256:71fbde8d269728a92be52f6401e857230043ee6938c45f810c32308d88fb9927","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"}],"issuedAtLedgerHead":"32422f71f16742f4b5b21b2b0d3e521ea80fd1f6","nodeId":"no-three-in-line/d77-distance-from-embedded-g76-152-record","nodeType":"lemma","parentId":"root","reportRef":{"artifact":"report.md","digest":"sha256:e31f2ee45062e97daaee63a38716f5d2ea4c6d50f02e9f3f5714c515e8b37ce6","section":"## Node: no-three-in-line/d77-distance-from-embedded-g76-152-record"},"revisionId":"sha256:114e0f062873037df5c0105c0fbad9f70ec5974da486808872eafe8408d4f90d","revisionNumber":1,"status":"active","subjects":[{"id":"c5e8096d942d57228bb4fed00f7617fb6b43af9f","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":2}],"summary":"For each specified embedding E, any no-three-in-line set S with at most two removals from E has at most one addition and size at most 152. Consequently, every such set of size at least 153 requires at least three removals and four additions relative to every specified embedding, hence symmetric-difference distance at least seven. This is a local constraint, not a global impossibility result.","title":"Distance constraint from the specified embedded G_76 152-point configurations"}
{"action":"revise","adjudicationId":"no-three-in-line/d77-exact-value","baseRevisionId":"sha256:c1fa94da976e885e587f595a3a3ae91d3f05aeab06bbea99738ab02a64bc94c8","evidence":[{"digest":null,"id":"dfc0cc40d41105292a119840dcdbe6f22860cf43","kind":"transaction","relation":"context"},{"digest":null,"id":"c5e8096d942d57228bb4fed00f7617fb6b43af9f","kind":"transaction","relation":"context"},{"digest":"sha256:71fbde8d269728a92be52f6401e857230043ee6938c45f810c32308d88fb9927","id":"sha256:71fbde8d269728a92be52f6401e857230043ee6938c45f810c32308d88fb9927","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"}],"issuedAtLedgerHead":"32422f71f16742f4b5b21b2b0d3e521ea80fd1f6","nodeId":"no-three-in-line/d77-exact-value","nodeType":"question","parentId":"root","reportRef":{"artifact":"report.md","digest":"sha256:e31f2ee45062e97daaee63a38716f5d2ea4c6d50f02e9f3f5714c515e8b37ce6","section":"## Node: no-three-in-line/d77-exact-value"},"revisionId":"sha256:59d94b5fed6f97cc9140cd8f10de26e8f8e2b0c371ccde049e36686246d1eb61","revisionNumber":2,"status":"active","subjects":[{"id":"dfc0cc40d41105292a119840dcdbe6f22860cf43","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":1}],"summary":"The exact value remains unresolved within 152 ≤ D(77) ≤ 154. The local computations exclude sets of size at least 153 within two removals of any specified embedding, but provide neither a 153- or 154-point certificate nor a global impossibility proof. The uncertainty remains an open mathematical question, not an adjudicative dispute.","title":"Exact value of D(77)"}
